IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-companies-domain`

§ `Part 11A — Register of Controllers, Nominee Directors and Nominee Shareholders`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Companies Act 1967 (Singapore), Part 11A, ss 386AA–386AP.
-- Source: SSO current version as at 07 Sep 2026.
--
-- Requires companies and foreign companies to maintain registers of
-- registrable controllers (beneficial ownership). Mostly definitional
-- and procedural; this encoding covers the computable deadlines.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `Register of controllers — s 386AF`


§§§ `s 386AF — Deadlines for keeping register`

-- s 386AF(1): company incorporated on/after 31 Mar 2017 — 30 days
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 386AF(1)"
`controller register days post 2017 company` MEANS 30

-- s 386AF(2): company incorporated before 31 Mar 2017 — 60 days
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 386AF(2)"
`controller register days pre 2017 company` MEANS 60

-- s 386AF(3): company newly subject to Part 11A — 60 days
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 386AF(3)"
`controller register days newly subject` MEANS 60

-- s 386AF(4): foreign company registered on/after 31 Mar 2017 — 30 days
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 386AF(4)"
`controller register days post 2017 foreign` MEANS 30

-- s 386AF(5): foreign company registered before 31 Mar 2017 — 60 days
@ref "Companies Act 1967, s 386AF(5)"
`controller register days pre 2017 foreign` MEANS 60


-- ===========================================================================
-- TEST CASES
-- ===========================================================================

§§ `Part 11A — Illustrations`

#ASSERT `controller register days post 2017 company` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `controller register days pre 2017 company` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `controller register days newly subject` EQUALS 60
#ASSERT `controller register days post 2017 foreign` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `controller register days pre 2017 foreign` EQUALS 60
